{
  "comment": "Menu of scaffoldable components, shared by the setup and update commands. src is relative to ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}; dest is relative to the project root. group drives the checkbox grouping; recommendWhen is a heuristic for pre-recommending.",
  "components": [
